    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000rl2n](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000rl2n) Magnitude 5.5 earthquake at 141.463 depth occurred on Nov 02 2025 16km SW of Mabinay. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 9.642 longitude 122.8092. It impacted 821968 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
